  "description": "One day, after two months of working cleaning bathrooms at a hotel, Johan's predecessor asks him to leave because he's coming back. All Johan has left is his younger brother, Philip. \n\nA man says to Johan that he resembles someone he knew well, and suddenly offers him a job. Maybe it's a scam or something dangerous, but it pays $5,000 a month. \n\nJohan now lives in a shabby, crumbling hut far away from the ridiculously huge mansion, but he's happy. That is, until he meets Herbert...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
